# # /biosig-zarr/
#
# https://w3id.org/biosig-zarr/ redirects to the biosig-zarr specification
# repository, https://github.com/nemarOrg/biosig-zarr
#
# biosig-zarr is a Zarr version 3 layout for one biosignal recording, and
# .bzx is its single-file form. It is maintained by NEMAR, the
# Neuroelectromagnetic Data Archive and Tools Resource (https://nemar.org).
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Seyed Yahya Shirazi (NEMAR)
# GitHub username: neuromechanist

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^ https://github.com/nemarOrg/biosig-zarr [R=302,L]
